  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Edmund Rice Development PROJECT: ERD in Peru aim to create opportunities for marginalised at risk students who are facing significant educational and social challenges, to access quality primary and secondary education through constant academic support, personal psychological and social assistance, and vocational and technical training opportunities. Activities will include personalized academic support focused on developing critical skills in math and Spanish, specialized psychological support to overcome challenges such as low self-esteem, anxiety, etc, helping access healthcare services for the students &amp; their families</narrative>
  </description>
